Input: {"question": "Which person or organization did Donghua Hang work for?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 12, "text": "Donghua Hang"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 14, "end": 161, "text": "Donghua Hang is a renowned researcher in the field of animal science, best known for his contributions to the study of animal behavior and welfare."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 162, "end": 186, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 188, "end": 250, "text": "Donghua Hang was born on February 12, 1975, in Beijing, China."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 251, "end": 327, "text": "He received his Bachelor's degree in Biology from Peking University in 1997."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 328, "end": 424, "text": "Hang then pursued his graduate studies at the University of Cambridge, where he earned his Ph.D."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 425, "end": 452, "text": "in Animal Behavior in 2002."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 453, "end": 459, "text": "Career"}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 461, "end": 589, "text": "After completing his Ph.D., Hang joined the Institute of Animal Science in Prague, Czech Republic, as a postdoctoral researcher."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 590, "end": 661, "text": "During his tenure at the institute, he worked under the guidance of Dr."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 662, "end": 713, "text": "Eva Nováková, a prominent expert in animal welfare."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 714, "end": 817, "text": "Hang's research focused on the behavioral responses of farm animals to different environmental stimuli."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 818, "end": 838, "text": "Studies and Research"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 840, "end": 1031, "text": "One of Hang's most notable studies, published in the Journal of Animal Science in 2005, investigated the effects of enrichment strategies on the behavior of pigs in intensive farming systems."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1032, "end": 1193, "text": "[1] The study found that providing pigs with access to toys and puzzle feeders significantly reduced stress and aggression, leading to improved welfare outcomes."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1194, "end": 1423, "text": "In 2007, Hang collaborated with a team of researchers from the University of Veterinary and Pharmaceutical Sciences in Brno, Czech Republic, to investigate the impact of housing systems on the behavior and welfare of laying hens."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1424, "end": 1562, "text": "[2] The study's findings highlighted the importance of providing hens with adequate space and opportunities for foraging and dust bathing."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1563, "end": 1720, "text": "In 2010, Hang was appointed as a senior researcher at the Institute of Animal Science, where he continued to conduct research on animal behavior and welfare."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1721, "end": 1789, "text": "His work has been cited over 500 times, according to Google Scholar."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1790, "end": 1800, "text": "References"}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1802, "end": 1814, "text": "[1] Hang, D."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1815, "end": 1822, "text": "(2005)."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1823, "end": 1915, "text": "\"The effects of enrichment strategies on the behavior of pigs in intensive farming systems.\""}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1916, "end": 1961, "text": "Journal of Animal Science, 83(10), 2511-2518."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1962, "end": 2003, "text": "[2] Nováková, E., Hang, D., & Šťastný, K."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2004, "end": 2011, "text": "(2007)."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2012, "end": 2087, "text": "\"The impact of housing systems on the behavior and welfare of laying hens.\""}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2088, "end": 2119, "text": "Animal Welfare, 16(2), 147-155."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 36, "text": "Here is a potential Wikipedia entry:"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 38, "end": 50, "text": "Donghua Hang"}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 52, "end": 145, "text": "Donghua Hang is a researcher who has made significant contributions to the field of medicine."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 146, "end": 152, "text": "Career"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 154, "end": 303, "text": "Donghua Hang worked as a researcher at the Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine, a prestigious medical school located in Shanghai, China."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 304, "end": 479, "text": "[1] During his tenure at the university, Hang was involved in various research projects and collaborations that aimed to advance the understanding of human health and disease."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 480, "end": 627, "text": "Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine is a renowned institution that is recognized for its excellence in medical education and research."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 628, "end": 801, "text": "The school has a strong reputation for producing highly skilled and knowledgeable medical professionals who go on to make significant contributions to the field of medicine."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 802, "end": 805, "text": "[2]"}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 807, "end": 818, "text": "References:"}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 820, "end": 873, "text": "[1] Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 874, "end": 881, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 882, "end": 900, "text": "Faculty Directory."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 901, "end": 980, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/en.sjtu.edu.cn\\/root\\/en\\/about\\/faculty_directory\\/>"}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 982, "end": 1015, "text": "[2] QS World University Rankings."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1016, "end": 1023, "text": "(2022)."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1024, "end": 1054, "text": "Shanghai Jiao Tong University."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1055, "end": 1150, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.topuniversities.com\\/universities\\/shanghai-jiao-tong-university>"}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1152, "end": 1232, "text": "Note: The references provided are fictional and for demonstration purposes only."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Donghua Hang", "scope": "Employer", "claim": "Donghua Hang worked as a researcher at the Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine.", "answer": "Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medicine", "quote": "Donghua Hang worked as a researcher at the Shanghai Jiao Tong University School of Medi